https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/BAGEL
The upstream Apache-2.0 license is reproduced in LICENSE. Original source
headers are retained. UniCache modifies attention hooks, cache metadata and
inference execution in its adapted BAGEL sources.

H2O scoring/selection and UniCache segment/GQA adaptations refer to:
https://github.com/FMInference/H2O
commit ac75c2a8a9e76832b2a4139b9363373b56336bfb
The type-aware adapters are not unmodified official H2O implementations.

Packed KIVI is an external build-time/runtime dependency, not bundled:
https://github.com/jy-yuan/KIVI
commit 876b4d2d08e3b1d5f70d0969c299d8c7c42ddfb6
patches/kivi_long_query_outer_dim.patch fixes multi-query addressing.
Observe the external repository's license when distributing its sources/binaries.

The inherited runtime also contains optional components referring to StreamingLLM,
SnapKV, PyramidKV, TaylorSeer and DuCa. Feature-reuse helpers are retained as
BAGEL import dependencies, but are not enabled by release presets. In particular,
modeling/cache_utils/taylorseer.py retains its original adaptation notice.

Model weights, benchmark data, third-party checkouts and compiled extensions
are not included and remain subject to their respective licenses.
